  "steps": [
    "Creation explicitly enables v3, adds a fallback and reorders it. A fallback before a later predicate blocks generation; cancelling changes no author files.",
    "Re-edit preserves condition inputs and row identity while moving nodes. Order changes revoke review; invalid fallback order is rejected. Valid review reproduces exact v3 bytes without author writes.",
    "Chinese, English and Japanese at 390px preserve the exact input, focus, selection, branch order and reviewed source without horizontal overflow.",
    "Apply updates only a draft; ordinary Save changes exactly one TXT. Reopening restores v3 order. Turning off branch mode preserves duplicate edges and rejects them until explicitly removed; Save then restores original v2 bytes."
  ],
